#: about.php include/global_arrays.php include/top_general_header.php
#: include/top_header.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Ku saabsan Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti waxaa loo naqshadeeyay inuu noqdo xal dhammaystiran oo garaafyo samayn ah oo ku salaysan xog-kaydiyaha waqti-taxanaha (TSDB) iyo xalka garaaf-samaynta ee RRDtool. Hadafkiisu waa inuu fududeeyo shaqada Maamulaha Shabakadda isagoo daryeelaya dhammaan faahfaahinta muhiimka ah ee lagama maarmaanka u ah samaynta Garaafyo macno leh."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Fadlan eeg %1$sbogga rasmiga ah ee Cacti%2$s si aad u hesho macluumaad ku saabsan sida loo isticmaalo Cacti, helitaanka taageerada, iyo cusboonaysiinta."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Horumariyayaasha Firfircoon"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Horumariyayaasha ka shaqaynaya Cacti, Qaab-dhismeedkiisa, Dukumeentiyada iyo Soo-saaryada Mustaqbalka."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Xusidda Sharafta leh"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Ka-qaybgalayaasha Dukumeentiyada, QA, Baakaynta, Golayaasha doodda iyo boggeenna YouTube."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Xubnihii Hore ee Sharafta leh"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Xubnihii kooxdii asalka ahayd ee Cacti Group ee tan iyo markaa u gudbay xirfado kale. Waxaan u sii rajaynaynaa waxa ugu wanaagsan."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Mahadcelin"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Mahadcelin aad u gaar ah ayaa u socota %1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, abuuraha %3$sRRDtool%4$s iyo barnaamijka caanka ah ee %5$sMRTG%6$s."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Isticmaalayaasha Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Gaar ahaan qof kasta oo waqti u huray inuu sameeyo warbixin cillad ah, ama si kale uga qayb qaatay xallinta dhibaatooyinka la xiriira Cacti. Sidoo kale qof kasta oo gacan ka geystay taageeridda Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Shatiga"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti waxaa shati looga dhigay GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Barnaamijkani waa software xor ah; dib ayaad u qaybin kartaa iyo/ama wax ka beddeli kartaa iyadoo la raacayo shuruudaha GNU General Public License sida ay u daabacday Free Software Foundation; ha ahaato nooca 2aad ee Shatiga, ama (ikhtiyaarkaaga) nooc kasta oo ka dambeeya."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Barnaamijkan waxaa loo qaybiyaa iyadoo la rajaynayo inuu faa'iido yeesho, laakiin MA LAHA WAX DAMMAANAD AH; xitaa ma laha dammaanad maldahan oo ku saabsan GANACSI KU-HABBOONAAN ama KU-HABBOONAAN UJEEDDO GAAR AH. Eeg GNU General Public License si aad u hesho faahfaahin dheeraad ah."

