msgstr "Wuxuu matalaa sharaxaadda u dambaysa ee la rabo in Aaladda loogu isticmaalo Cacti.  Qiimayaasha beddelka ee soo socda waa la isticmaali karaa: |sysName|, |ipAddress|, |dnsName|, |dnsShortName|, |sysLocation|.  Hawlaha soo socda sidoo kale waa la isticmaali karaa: CONCAT(), SUBSTRING(), SUBSTRING_INDEX().  Ka eeg dukumeentiga MySQL/MariaDB tusaalooyinka sida loo isticmaalo hawlahan.  Tusaale wuxuu noqon karaa: CONCAT('|sysName|', SUBSTRING('|sysLocation|',1,3)).  Ka taxaddar inaad calaamadda xigashada ku darto hareeraha magacyada doorsoomayaasha marka lagu isticmaalo tusaalooyinka hawlaha MySQL/MariaDB ee la taageero."

