#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Based upon the Aggregation Level, the Rows, and the Polling Interval the amount of data that will be retained in the RRA"
msgstr "Iyadoo lagu saleynayo Heerka Ururinta, Safafka, iyo Faraq-waqtiga Xog-ururinta, qadarka xogta lagu hayn doono RRA-ga"

#: include/global_form.php
