msgid "Based upon the number of Rows and the number of Consolidation Functions selected, the size of this RRA in the RRDfile."
msgstr "Iyadoo lagu saleynayo tirada Safafka iyo tirada Hawlaha Isku-darka ee la doortay, cabbirka RRA-gan ee ku jira RRDfile."

