msgstr "Haddii goobtan ay si gaar ah ula dhaqmaan qaab-dhismeedyada martigeliyaha, halkan ku muuji. Erayada furaha ah ee saxda ah ee goobtan waa %s"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this data template."
msgstr "Magaca la siiyay qaab-dhismeedkan xogta."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose a name for this data source.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Dooro magac ilahan xogta.  Waxaa ku jiri kara doorsoomayaal beddelaad ah sida |host_description| ama |query_fieldName|.  Liis dhammaystiran oo ah summadaha beddelaadda ee la taageero, fadlan eeg dukumeentiga Cacti."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Path"
msgstr "Waddada Isha Xogta"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The full path to the RRDfile."
msgstr "Waddada buuxda ee loo maro RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The script/source used to gather data for this data source."
msgstr "Qoraalka (script)/isha loo adeegsado ururinta xogta ishan xogta."

#: include/global_form.php package_import.php
msgid "Select the Data Source Profile.  The Data Source Profile controls polling interval, the data aggregation, and retention policy for the resulting Data Sources."
msgstr "Dooro Astaanta Isha Xogta.  Astaanta Isha Xogta waxay xakamaysaa faraq-waqtiga xog-ururinta, ururinta xogta, iyo siyaasadda haynta ee Ilaha Xogta ka soo baxa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The amount of time in seconds between expected updates."
msgstr "Muddada waqtiga oo ilbiriqsiyo ah ee u dhexeysa cusboonaysiinta la filayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Active"
msgstr "Isha Xogta waa Firfircoon tahay"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Whether Cacti should gather data for this data source or not."
msgstr "Haddii Cacti ay u ururiso xogta ishan xogta iyo in kale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Internal Data Source Name"
msgstr "Magaca Gudaha ee Isha Xogta"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose unique name to represent this piece of data inside of the RRDfile."
msgstr "Dooro magac gaar ah oo matalaya qaybtan xogta ee ku jirta gudaha RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Minimum Value (\"U\" for No Minimum)"
msgstr "Qiimaha Ugu Yar (\"U\" haddii uusan jirin Ugu Yar)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Qiimaha ugu yar ee xogta ee la oggol yahay in la ururiyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Maximum Value (\"U\" for No Maximum)"
msgstr "Qiimaha Ugu Badan (\"U\" haddii uusan jirin Ugu Badan)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Qiimaha ugu badan ee xogta ee la oggol yahay in la ururiyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Type"
msgstr "Nooca Isha Xogta"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data is represented in the RRA."
msgstr "Sida xogta loogu matalo RRA-ga."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time that can pass before data is entered as 'unknown'. (Usually 2x300=600)"
msgstr "Muddada ugu badan ee waqtiga ee dhaafi karta ka hor inta aan xogta loo gelin sidii 'aan la aqoon'. (Inta badan 2x300=600)"

#: include/global_form.php lib/html_utility.php
msgid "Not Selected"
msgstr "Lama Dooran"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When data is gathered, the data for this field will be put into this data source."
msgstr "Marka xogta la ururiyo, xogta goobtan waxaa la gelin doonaa ishan xogta."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this GPRINT preset, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Geli magac dejintan hore ee GPRINT, hubi inay tahay wax aad garanayso."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Text"
msgstr "Qoraalka GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter the custom GPRINT string here."
msgstr "Halkan geli qoraalka gaarka ah ee GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Common Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Caadiga ah"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Cinwaanka (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Magaca ku daabacan shaxanka.  Waxaa ku jiri kara doorsoomayaal beddelaad ah sida |host_description| ama |query_fieldName|.  Liis dhammaystiran oo ah summadaha beddelaadda ee la taageero, fadlan eeg dukumeentiga Cacti."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Calaamadda Tooska ah (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Calaamadda si toos ah ugu daabacan dhanka bidix ee shaxanka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Qaabka Sawirka (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Nooca shaxanka la soo saaray; PNG, GIF ama SVG.  Doorashada nooca sawirka shaxanku waxay aad ugu xiran tahay RRDtool."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Dhererka (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Joogga (biksal ahaan) ee aagga garaafka ee ku dhex jira garaafka. Aaggan kuma jiraan furaha garaafka, sharaxaadda dhidibbada, ama cinwaanka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Ballaca (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Ballaca (biksal ahaan) ee aagga garaafka ee ku dhex jira garaafka. Aaggan kuma jiraan furaha garaafka, sharaxaadda dhidibbada, ama cinwaanka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Qiimaha Aasaasiga ah (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Waa in loo dejiyaa 1024 cabbiraadda xusuusta iyo 1000 cabbiraadda taraafikada."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label Angle (--vertical-label-angle)"
msgstr "Xagasha Summadda Toosan (--vertical-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "RRDtool Default"
msgstr "U-yaalka RRDtool"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank uses the RRDtool default. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Wareegga summadda oo digrii ah dhinaca lidka ku ah saacadda. Waxay u baahan tahay RRDtool 1.11 ama ka cusub. Haddii la banneeyo waxaa la adeegsadaa u-yaalka RRDtool. Xaglaha aan ahayn 90 iyo 270 waxay is dulsaari karaan waxyaabaha u dhow."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Habka Janjeerka (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Isticmaalka Habka Janjeerka wuxuu simaa qaabka garaafyada iyadoo ay wax yar hoos u dhacayso tayada muuqalka shaashadda."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Miisaamidda"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Miisaamidda Tooska ah"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto scale the y-axis instead of defining an upper and lower limit. Note: if this is check both the Upper and Lower limit will be ignored."
msgstr "Si toos ah u miisaam dhidibka-y halkii aad ka qeexi lahayd xadka sare iyo xadka hoose. Fiiro gaar ah: haddii tan la calaamadeeyo labada xad ee Sare iyo Hooseba waa la iska indho tiri doonaa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Miisaamidda Tooska ah"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Adeegso <br> --alt-autoscale si aad ugu miisaanto qiimaha ugu yar iyo kan ugu badan ee dhabta ah <br> --alt-autoscale-max si aad ugu miisaanto qiimaha ugu badan, adigoo adeegsanaya xad hoose oo la siiyay <br> --alt-autoscale-min si aad ugu miisaanto qiimaha ugu yar, adigoo adeegsanaya xad sare oo la siiyay <br> --alt-autoscale (oo leh xadad) si aad ugu miisaanto adigoo adeegsanaya labada xad ee hoose iyo sareba (u-yaalka RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Adeegso --alt-autoscale (iyadoo la iska indho tirayo xadadka la siiyay)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Adeegso --alt-autoscale-max (iyadoo la aqbalayo xad hoose)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Adeegso --alt-autoscale-min (iyadoo la aqbalayo xad sare)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Adeegso --alt-autoscale (iyadoo la aqbalayo labada xadba, u-yaalka RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Miisaamidda Logaritmikga (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Adeegso miisaamidda logaritmikga ee dhidibka-y"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "Halbeegyada SI ee Miisaamidda Logaritmikga (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Adeegso Halbeegyada SI ee Miisaamidda Logaritmikga halkii aad ka adeegsan lahayd qoraalka jibbaarada.<br> Fiiro gaar ah: Garaafyada toosan waxay si u-yaal ah u adeegsadaan qoraalka SI."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Habka Xadadka Adag (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Ha ballaarin xadka hoose iyo kan sare haddii garaafku ka kooban yahay qiime ka baxsan xadka saxda ah."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Xadka Sare (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Qiimaha toosan ee ugu badan ee garaafka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Xadka Hoose (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Qiimaha toosan ee ugu yar ee garaafka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Shabaqa"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Qiimaha Shabaqa Halbeegga (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Wuxuu dejiyaa qiimaha jibbaarka ee dhidibka-Y ee tirooyinka. Fiiro gaar ah: Ikhtiyaarkan waa mid duugoobay oo lagu beddelay ikhtiyaarka --y-grid. Ikhtiyaarkan dhexdiisa, xariiqaha shabaqa dhidibka-Y waxay ka muuqdaan tallaabo kasta oo shabaqa ah. Summadaha waxaa la dhigaa xariiq kasta oo ah qodobka summadda."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Qiimaha Jibbaarka Halbeegga (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Halbeegga ay tahay in Cacti ku adeegsado dhidibka-Y. Adeegso 3 si wax walba loogu muujiyo \"k\" ama -6 si wax walba loogu muujiyo \"u\" (maykro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Dhererka Halbeegga (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Immisa lambar ayay tahay in RRDtool u qaadato inay yihiin summadaha dhidibka-y? Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad u baahato inaad adeegsato ikhtiyaarkan si aad u samayso meel ku filan marka aad bilowdo wax ka beddelka summadaynta dhidibka-y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Gridfit La'aan (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Si looga fogaado saamaynta madmadowga ee anti-aliasing, RRDtool wuxuu dhibcaha ku toosiyaa biksallada tayada qalabka, taasoo keenta muuqaal aad u cad. Haddii aysan tani ku qancin, waxaad adeegsan kartaa furahan si aad u damiso habdhaqankan.<br><strong>Fiiro gaar ah: </strong>Gridfitting si u-yaal ah ayuu u dansan yahay soo-saarka PDF, EPS, SVG."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Shabaqa Y ee Beddelka ah (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Algoritamku wuxuu hubiyaa inaad mar walba leedahay shabaq, inay jiraan xariiqo shabaq oo ku filan laakiin aan badnayn, iyo in shabaqu yahay mitirik. Cabirkani wuxuu kaloo hubin doonaa inaad hesho tirooyin jajab tobanle ah oo ku filan oo la soo bandhigo xitaa haddii garaafkaagu ka socdo 69.998 ilaa 70.001.<br><strong>Fiiro gaar ah: </strong>Cabirkani wuxuu faragelin ku samayn karaa ikhtiyaarrada --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Dhidibka"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Dhidibka Midig (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Dhidib labaad ayaa lagu sawiri doonaa dhanka midig ee garaafka. Waxaa lagu xiraa dhidibka bidix iyada oo loo marayo cabbirrada miisaanka iyo wareejinta."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Summadda Dhidibka Midig (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Summadda loogu talagalay dhidibka midig."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Angle (--right-axis-label-angle)"
msgstr "Xagasha Summadda Dhidibka Midig (--right-axis-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank follows the vertical label angle. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Wareegga summadda midig oo digrii ah dhinaca lidka ku ah saacadda. Waxay u baahan tahay RRDtool 1.11 ama ka cusub. Haddii la banneeyo waxay raacdaa xagasha summadda toosan. Xaglaha aan ahayn 90 iyo 270 waxay is dulsaari karaan waxyaabaha u dhow."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Range (--right-axis-range)"
msgstr "Baaxadda Summadda Dhidibka Midig (--right-axis-range)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Only show right axis labels within min:max, for example 0:100. Either bound may be blank. This does not change the axis scale. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank leaves labels unrestricted."
msgstr "Keliya muuji summadaha dhidibka midig ee ku dhex jira min:max, tusaale ahaan 0:100. Labada xad midkood wuu bannaanaan karaa. Tani ma beddesho miisaanka dhidibka. Waxay u baahan tahay RRDtool 1.11 ama ka cusub. Haddii la banneeyo summaduhu waxay ahaadaan kuwo aan xaddidnayn."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Qaabka Dhidibka Midig (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Si caadi ah, qaabka calaamadaha dhidibka waxaa loo go'aamiyaa si otomaatig ah. Haddii aad rabto inaad adigu tan samayso, isticmaal ikhtiyaarkan adigoo adeegsanaya isla doodaha %lf ee aad ka taqaanno amarrada PRINT iyo GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Qaabeeyaha Dhidibka Midig (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Marka aad dejinayso calaamadeynta dhidibka midig, ku dabaq xeer qaabka xogta. Qaababka la taageero waxaa ka mid ah \"numeric\" oo xogta loola dhaqmo sida tirooyin, \"timestamp\" oo qiimayaasha loo fasiro sidii waqti-shaabbadaha UNIX (tirada ilbiriqsiyada tan iyo Janaayo 1970) laguna muujiyo qaabka strftime (qaabka caadiga ahi waa \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Eeg sidoo kale --units-length iyo --right-axis-format. Ugu dambayntii \"duration\" oo qiimayaasha loo fasiro sidii muddo ku cabbiran millisekan. Qaabayntu waxay raacdaa xeerarka PRINT/GPRINT ee u qalma valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Format (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Qaabka Dhidibka Bidix (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Qaabeeyaha Dhidibka Bidix (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Marka aad dejinayso calaamadeynta dhidibka bidix, ku dabaq xeer qaabka xogta. Qaababka la taageero waxaa ka mid ah \"numeric\" oo xogta loola dhaqmo sida tirooyin, \"timestamp\" oo qiimayaasha loo fasiro sidii waqti-shaabbadaha UNIX (tirada ilbiriqsiyada tan iyo Janaayo 1970) laguna muujiyo qaabka strftime (qaabka caadiga ahi waa \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Eeg sidoo kale --units-length. Ugu dambayntii \"duration\" oo qiimayaasha loo fasiro sidii muddo ku cabbiran millisekan. Qaabayntu waxay raacdaa xeerarka PRINT/GPRINT ee u qalma valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Furaha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Buuxinta Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Buuxi qoraalka si furaha iyo xogta garaafka ay had iyo jeer isugu toosnaadaan. Xusuusnow: tani waxay keeni kartaa in garaafyadu waqti dheer ku qaataan soo-bandhigidda culayska dheeraadka ah dartiis. Sidoo kale Buuxinta Otomaatigga ah waxaa laga yaabaa inaysan sax ku ahayn dhammaan noocyada garaafyada, calaamadeynta joogtada ahna badanaa way caawisaa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Calaamadaha Isbeddelaya (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "U sawir calaamadaha xariiqda sidii xariiq."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Ku Qasab Furaha Xeerarka (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Ku qasab soo-saarista furayaasha HRULE iyo VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Ballaca Tab-ka (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Si caadi ah ballaca tab-ku waa 40 biksal, isticmaal ikhtiyaarkan si aad u beddesho."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Booska Furaha (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Dhig furaha dhinaca la siiyay ee garaafka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Jihada Furaha (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "U dhig walxaha furaha sida tooska ah ee la siiyay."

