msgstr "Cufnaanta midabka darajada."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Height"
msgstr "Dhererka Darajada"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Gradient Height parameter can create three different behaviors. If it is > 0, then the gradient is a fixed height, starting at the line going down. If it is < 0, then the gradient starts at a fixed height above the x-axis, going down to the x-axis. If it is == 0, then the gradient goes from the top of the area fill to x-axis."
msgstr "Cabirka Dhererka Darajada wuxuu abuuri karaa saddex dhaqan oo kala duwan. Haddii uu yahay > 0, markaas darajadu waa dherer go'an, oo ka bilaabmaya xariiqda una socda hoos. Haddii uu yahay < 0, markaas darajadu waxay ka bilaabataa dherer go'an oo ka sarreeya dhidibka x, iyadoo hoos ugu socota dhidibka x. Haddii uu yahay == 0, markaas darajadu waxay ka bilaabataa xagga sare ee buuxinta aagga ilaa dhidibka x."

