msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Shaqada VDEF (xisaabta) ee lagu dabaqayo shaygan furaha garaafka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Wareeji Xogta"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Ka wareeji xogtaada dhidibka waqtiga (dhidibka x) qaddarka lagu cayimay goobta 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Qiimaha shayga garaafka.<br/> [TICK]: Qaybta xariiqda calaamadda.<br/> [SHIFT]: Kala-duwanaanshaha waqtiga ee ilbiriqsiyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Nooca GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Haddii shaygan garaafka uu yahay GPRINT, waxaad ikhtiyaar ahaan halkan ka dooran kartaa qaab kale. Waxaad ku qeexi kartaa noocyo dheeraad ah hoosta \"GPRINT Presets\"."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Toosinta Qoraalka (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Dhammaan sadar(rada) furaha ee xiga waxaa loo toosin doonaa sida halkan lagu siiyay. Waxaad isticmaali kartaa amarkan dhowr jeer hal garaaf gudaheed. Amarkani ma soo saaro qaab jadwal ah.<br/><strong>Xusuusin: </strong>Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad rabto inaad geliso &lt;HR&gt; shayga garaafka ee ka horreeya.<br/> <strong>Xusuusin: </strong>&lt;HR&gt; ku jira sadarkan furaha wuxuu burin doonaa dejintan!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Qaabka Qoraalka"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Qoraalka lagu soo bandhigi doono furaha ee shaygan garaafka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend for Export/Hover"
msgstr "Furaha Dhoofinta/Dul-istaagga"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A Legend to be displayed when Hovering over the Graph and also used for Graph Export.  Hover requires RRDtool 1.9.1 and above.  It may work for RRDtool 1.8+, but not for Thold Legends."
msgstr "Fure la soo bandhigo marka dul-istaag lagu sameeyo Garaafka sidoo kalena loo isticmaalo Dhoofinta Garaafka. Dul-istaaggu wuxuu u baahan yahay RRDtool 1.9.1 iyo wixii ka sarreeya. Waxaa laga yaabaa inay u shaqayso RRDtool 1.8+, laakiin uma shaqayso Furayaasha Thold."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Geli Sadar-beddel Adag"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Wuxuu ku qasbaa furaha inuu u gudbo sadarka xiga shaygan ka dib."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Line Width (decimal)"
msgstr "Ballaca Xariiqda (tobanle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In case LINE was chosen, specify width of line here.  You must include a decimal precision, for example 2.00"
msgstr "Haddii LINE la doortay, halkan ku qeex ballaca xariiqda. Waa inaad ku dartaa saxnaanta jajab tobanle, tusaale ahaan 2.00"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Xariiqo goosgoosan (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

