#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Calaamadee sanduuqan haddii aad rabto inaad tijaabiso Ilaha Xogta ka hor inta aan la abuurin. Marka Tijaabi Ilaha Xogta la hawlgeliyo, haddii Isha Xogtu aysan soo celin xog sax ah, Garaafka lama abuuri doono. Dejintani waxay muhiim u tahay haddii aad rabto inaad yeelato Qaab-samayseed Qalab oo guud kaas oo ku dari kara Qaab-samayseedyo Garaaf oo badan oo si xulasho leh loo dabaqi karo iyadoo ku xiran sifooyinka Qalabka laftiisa. Ogeysiis: Haddii aad leedahay qoraal (script) muddo dheer socda oo ah Il Xog, waqtiga abuurista Garaafyada wuu kordhi doonaa."

