#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Actions"
msgstr "Ficillada Diiwaanka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What Log Actions do you wish to provide to the Cacti Administrator.  You can grant either purge, rotate, or both purge and rotate.  Base files can be both purged and rotated, and already rotated files can only be purged if you grant that permission."
msgstr "Ficilladee Diiwaanka ayaad rabtaa inaad siiso Maamulaha Cacti. Waxaad siin kartaa tirtirid (purge), wareejin (rotate), ama labadaba. Faylasha aasaasiga ah waa la tirtiri karaa waana la wareejin karaa labadaba, halka faylasha horay loo wareejiyay kaliya la tirtiri karo haddii aad fasaxaas bixiso."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Generic Log Level"
msgstr "Heerka Guud ee Diiwaanka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file.  WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Heer kee faahfaahin ah ayaad rabtaa in loo diro faylka diiwaanka. DIGNIIN: Ka tagidda xaalad aan ahayn NONE ama LOW waxay si dhakhso ah u dhameyn kartaa booska saxankaaga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expand log details"
msgstr "Ballaari faahfaahinta diiwaanka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of expansion do you want on the log file? Increase expansion can slow search results"
