#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cacti will mask certain errors that are often times considered fatal and that would otherwise disable plugins and additionally confuse some users.  If you wish to see these errors instead, check the checkbox."
msgstr "Cacti waxay qarin doontaa khaladaad gaar ah oo inta badan loo arko kuwo halis ah kuwaas oo haddii kale curyaamin lahaa plugins-ka sidoo kalena jahwareerin lahaa isticmaalayaasha qaar. Haddii aad rabto inaad aragto khaladaadkan taa beddelkeeda, calaamadee sanduuqa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Selective File Debug"
msgstr "Cilad-saarka Faylka ee Xulashada ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select which files you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the Generic Log Level setting.  Any files selected will be treated as they are in Debug mode."
msgstr "Dooro faylasha aad rabto inaad geliso habka Debug iyadoon loo eegin dejinta Heerka Guud ee Diiwaanka. Fayl kasta oo la doorto waxaa loola dhaqmi doonaa sidii isagoo ku jira habka Debug."

#: include/global_settings.php
