msgstr "Liis hakad ku kala soocan oo ah Aqoonsiyada Aaladaha (Device IDs) ee aad rabto inay ku jiraan habka Debug inta lagu jiro ururinta xogta. Heerkan Debug wuxuu shaqeeyaa oo keliya inta lagu jiro habka cod-ururinta ee Cacti."

