msgid "Enabled Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Taageerada Gradient waa la daaray jaantusyada AREA iyo STACK."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Habka Ogolaanshaha Garaafyada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Waxaa jira afar hab oo lagu go'aamiyo Ogolaanshaha Garaafyada ee Isticmaalaha. Midda koowaad waa 'Debecsan'. Habka 'Debecsan', isticmaaluhu wuxuu u baahan yahay oo keliya inuu galaangal u yeesho mid ka mid ah Garaafka, Aaladda, ama Qaab-dhismeedka Garaafka si uu u helo Garaafyada khuseeya. Habka 'Xaddidan', isticmaaluhu waa inuu galaangal u leeyahay Garaafka, Aaladda, iyo Qaab-dhismeedka Garaafka si uu u helo Garaafka. Labadan hab ee hore waxay leeyihiin caqabado ballaarinta ah marka rakibaaddu aad u weyn tahay. Sidaa darteed, laba ikhtiyaar oo dheeraad ah ayaa diyaar ah. Waxay kala yihiin 'Ku Saleysan Aaladda', taas oo macnaheedu yahay haddii aad galaangal u leedahay Aaladda, aad heli doonto garaafyadeeda. Ugu dambeyntiina 'Ku Saleysan Qaab-dhismeedka Garaafka', taas oo macnaheedu yahay haddii aad galaangal u leedahay 'Qaab-dhismeedka Garaafka', aad heli doonto dhammaan Garaafyada Aaladaha ee Qaab-dhismeedkaas."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Debecsan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Xaddidan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Ku Saleysan Aaladda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Habka Abuurista Garaafka/Isha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Haddii loo dejiyo Fudud, Garaafyada iyo Ilaha Xogta waxaa laga abuuri karaa oo keliya Garaafyada Cusub. Haddii loo dejiyo Sare, abuurista Garaafka iyo Isha Xogta ee habkii hore waa la taageerayaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Fudud"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Sare"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Muuji Caawimaadda Foomka/Dejinta Gudaha Bogga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, Caawimaadda Foomka iyo Dejinta waxaa lagu muujin doonaa gudaha bogga. Haddii kale waxaa la soo bandhigi doonaa marka dul-istaago badhanka caawimaadda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Caawimaadda Bogga ee Gudaha Keliya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Sida caadiga ah caawimaadda bogga Cacti waxay ku taal docs.cacti.net. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, haddii nidaamkaagu aanu lahayn marin Internet, waxaad soo dejisan kartaa dukumeentiyada qaab HTML ah oo gudaha ah waxaadna ku martigelin kartaa goobta 'docs' ee server-kaaga Cacti. Haddii aad doorato inaad isticmaasho goobta gudaha oo keliya dukumeentiga caawimaadda bogga, calaamadee sanduuqan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Xaqiijinta Tirtiridda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Waydii isticmaalaha ka hor inta aan shayga la tirtirin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Dejinta Hore ee Ilaalinta Isha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Marka la hawlgeliyo, Cacti wuxuu u dejin doonaa Badhanka Raadiyaha inuu Tirtiro Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira Garaafka marka laga saarayo Garaafyada. Fiiro gaar ah: Cacti ma oggolaan doono in laga saaro Ilaha Xogta haddii lagu isticmaalo Garaafyo kale."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Furitaanka Tooska ah ee Garaafyada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Marka la hawlgeliyo, Cacti ma qufuli doono Garaafyada. Tani waxay oggolaanaysaa wax ka beddel gacanta ah oo dhakhso leh oo lagu sameeyo Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira Garaafka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Qari Dashboard-ka Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Waxaa loo isticmaalaa Taageerada Xiriiriyaha Dibadda ee Cacti. Adigoo adeegsanaya dejintan, waxaad qarin kartaa Dashboard-ka Cacti, si aad u muujiso boggaaga gaarka ah oo keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Jiid-oo-Dhig"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah is-dhexgalka Cacti waxay taageeraan Jiid-oo-Dhig. Haddii la calaamadiyo ikhtiyaarkan waa la hawlgelin doonaa. Fiiro gaar ah: Isticmaalayaasha aragga naafada ka ah, ikhtiyaarkan waa la damin karaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub/GitLab API Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta API ee GitHub/GitLab"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base API Repository URL"
msgstr "URL-ka Aasaasiga ah ee Kaydka API"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub or GitLab enter the GitHub or GitLab API url here.  The default is https://api.github.com/.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Haddii aad rabto inaad si toos ah uga hesho noocyada ugu dambeeya ee plugins-ka GitHub ama GitLab, geli URL-ka API ee GitHub ama GitLab halkan. Kan caadiga ah waa https://api.github.com/. Beddel kan oo keliya haddii aad leedahay kayd kuu gaar ah oo aad u hayso Cacti Plugins."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub User Account"
msgstr "Akoonka Isticmaalaha GitHub"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The User account that holds your GitHub/GitLab repositories.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Akoonka isticmaalaha ee haya kaydadkaaga GitHub/GitLab. Beddel kan oo keliya haddii aad leedahay kayd kuu gaar ah oo aad u hayso Cacti Plugins."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Personal Access Token"
msgstr "Calaamadda Gelitaanka Gaarka ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub without overly restricted rate limiting, enter your Personal Access Token here."
msgstr "Haddii aad rabto inaad si toos ah uga hesho noocyada ugu dambeeya ee plugins-ka GitHub adigoon la kulmin xaddidaad adag oo heerka codsiyada ah, geli Calaamaddaada Gelitaanka Gaarka ah halkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Unsafe Plugin Installs"
msgstr "Hawlgeli Rakibaadda Plugin-ka aan Ammaanka ahayn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you would like to allow the installation of Cacti Plugins from their 'develop' branch, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad oggolaato rakibidda Cacti Plugins laga bilaabo laantooda 'develop', calaamadee sanduuqan."

