#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Data Source and Graph Template Suggested Value Records.  Graphs and Data Sources will take on new names after either a Data Query Reindex or by using the forced Replace Suggested Values process."
msgstr "Beddel Diiwaanada Qiimaha la Soo Jeediyay ee Isha Xogta iyo Qaab-dhismeedka Garaafka. Garaafyada iyo Ilaha Xogta waxay qaadan doonaan magacyo cusub ka dib dib-u-tixraaca Weydiinta Xogta ama iyadoo la adeegsanayo habka qasabka ah ee Beddelka Qiimaha la Soo Jeediyay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Amniga Goobta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Ku Qasab Xiriirrada HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, isku day kasta oo lagu galo Cacti waxaa loo weecin doonaa HTTPS si loo xaqiijiyo amni sare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Ilaalinta JavaScript-ka Gudaha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Waxay maamushaa sida Content-Security-Policy ay u xaddiddo JavaScript-ga ku dhex jira. HTMX waxay haysaa siyaasadda 'unsafe-inline' ee dhammaan mawduucyada iyo adeegyada dheeraadka ah ee hadda jira ay ku tiirsan yihiin waxayna la mid tahay habdhaqankii noocyadii hore. Guuritaanka Nonce waxay soo saartaa siyaasad nonce adag oo ku jirta qaabka warbixin-kaliya si loo aqoonsado qoraallada asaasiga ah iyo kuwa dheeraadka ah ee aan is-waafaqsanayn iyadoo aan UI-ga la jebin. Dhaqangelinta Nonce waxay xannibtaa qoraallada aan lahayn nonce-ga codsiga waxayna u baahan tahay in CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE ay ahaato true gudaha include/config.php; haddii uusan jirin albaabkaas cad waxay si ammaan ah ugu sii jirtaa qaabka warbixin-kaliya. None waxay sidoo kale oggolaataa wicitaannada eval() ee aan ammaanka ahayn waana doorashada ugu xaddidaadda yar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Caadi)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Guuritaanka Nonce (Warbixin Kaliya)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Dhaqangelinta Nonce (Horumarsan)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI-ga Warbixinta Xadgudubka CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Waxaa loo isticmaalaa qaababka Guuritaanka Nonce iyo Dhaqangelinta Nonce. URL-ka ay biraawsarradu u diraan warbixinnada xadgudubka Content-Security-Policy. Bannaanka u daa si aad u isticmaasho maareeyaha la socda ee csp_report.php hoos yimaada jidka URL-ka Cacti ee la habeeyay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Ilaha Beddelka ah ee Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Magacyada domeenka ee meel bannaan lagu kala saaray kuwaas oo loo oggolaan doono in laga galo meel ka baxsan Web Server-ka laftiisa. Tani waxay muhiim u tahay isticmaalayaasha doorta inay isticmaalaan CDN, ama goob martigelin ah. Ilaha waxaa ku jiri kara calaamadaha guud (wildcards) tusaale ahaan: *.mydomain.com, ama borotokool, tusaale ahaan: https://*.example.com. Ilahan Beddelka ah waxay ku kooban yihiin noocyada Sawirka, CSS iyo JavaScript kaliya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Daar htmx si loo cusbooneysiiyo shaandhooyinka meeshaas ku jira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Marka la daaro, soo-raraha htmx waa lagu daraa si boggaga doorta ay u cusbooneysiin karaan natiijooyinka shaandhada iyadoo aan bogga oo dhan dib loo soo rarin. Demi kaliya haddii qaybaha dheeraadka ah ay si khaldan u shaqeeyaan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "Daaran (caadi)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Damsan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Wakiilka Fog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo Ururiyeyaal Xog badan, kuwani waa Dejimaha Xiriirka u dhexeeya Ururiyeyaasha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Dekedda TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Dekedda TCP ee loo isticmaalo la-xiriiridda Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog. Borotokoolku wuxuu la mid noqon doonaa adeegaha shabakadda ee Cacti-ga Dhexe (HTTP ama HTTPS). Bannaanka u daa si aad u isticmaasho dekedaha caadiga ah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Muddada waqtiga, ilbiriqsiyo ahaan, ee adeegaha shabakadda ee Cacti-ga Dhexe uu sugi doono jawaabta Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog si loo helo macluumaad kala duwan oo Qalabka ah ka hor inta uusan ka tanaasulin codsiga. Qalabka ku xiran Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee aan ahayn Ururiyaha Xogta ee Cacti-ga Dhexe, waa in la isticmaalo Wakiilka Fog si loo ururiyo macluumaadka Qalabka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Xaqiiji Shahaadooyinka TLS ee Wakiilka Fog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "U baahan shahaado la aamini karo oo magaceedu la mid yahay magaca martigeliyaha (hostname) ee Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog. Demi kaliya marka la beddelayo shahaadooyinka hore ee is-saxiixay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Maya (Shahaado Hore oo Is-saxiixday)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Faylka CA ee Wakiilka Fog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Jid buuxa oo ikhtiyaari ah oo u taga xirmada PEM CA ee loo isticmaalo xaqiijinta shahaadooyinka Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog. Bannaanka u daa si aad u isticmaasho kaydka kalsoonida nidaamka ee PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Heerka Diiwaangelinta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Heerka diiwaangelinta ee hawlaha Otomaatigga. Heerarku waa Hoose, Dhexdhexaad iyo Sare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Ku Qasab Baaritaannada Otomaatigga ee Taxanaha ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Marka la daaro, Otomaatigga Cacti wuxuu baari doonaa hal shabakad markiiba isagoon isku mar (Parallel) wada baarin. Dejintani waxay faa'iido yeelan kartaa marka Adeegayaasha Shabakadda ee Cacti ay leeyihiin xuddunno (cores) xaddidan oo fuliya hubinta Otomaatigga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Daar Abuurista Jaantusyada ee Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Marka la demiyo, Otomaatigga Cacti si firfircoon uma abuuri doono wax Jaantus ah. Tani waxay faa'iido leedahay marka la hagaajinayo dejimaha Qalabka si looga fogaado abuurista Jaantusyo cusub mar kasta oo aad kaydiso shay. U-yeerista Xeerarka Otomaatigga si gacanta ah weli way suurtagal ahaan doontaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Daar Abuurista Shayga Geedka ee Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Marka la demiyo, Otomaatigga Cacti si firfircoon uma abuuri doono wax Shay Geed ah. Tani waxay faa'iido leedahay marka la hagaajinayo dejimaha Qalabka ama Jaantuska si looga fogaado abuurista Gelitaanno Geed oo cusub mar kasta oo aad kaydiso shay. U-yeerista Xeerarka si gacanta ah weli way suurtagal ahaan doontaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Iimaylka Loo Diro Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee loo diro Iimayllada Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga haddii aan lagu cayimin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga. Haddii midkood goobtan, ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga bannaanka loo daayo, Cacti wuxuu isticmaali doonaa koontada Iimaylka ee Maamulaha Koowaad ee Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Magaca Diraha Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Magaca Iimaylka ee loo isticmaalo Iimayllada Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga haddii aan lagu cayimin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga. Haddii midkood goobtan, ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga bannaanka loo daayo, Cacti wuxuu isticmaali doonaa Magaca Diraha ee caadiga ah ee nidaamka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Iimaylka Diraha Ogeysiinta Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee loo adeegsado Iimaylada Ogeysiisyada Otomaatigga ah haddii aan lagu qeexin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga ah.  Haddii midkood goobtan, ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga ah loo daayo bannaanaan, Cacti wuxuu adeegsan doonaa Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee Ka Yimid (From) ee caadiga ah ee nidaamka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Qiyamka Caadiga ah ee Qaabka Garaafka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Isha Xogta Tijaabada ee Qaabka Garaafka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Calamaadi sanduuqan haddii aad rabto inaad tijaabiso Ilaha Xogta ka hor inta aan la samayn Qaababka Garaafka ee cusub iyo kuwa dhowaan la soo dejiyay.  Marka Ilaha Xogta Tijaabada la hawlgeliyo, haddii Isha Xogtu aysan soo celin xog sax ah, Garaafka lama samayn doono.  Dejintani waa muhiim haddii aad rabto inaad yeelato Qaab Aalad oo guud oo ku dari kara Qaabab Garaaf oo badan kuwaas oo si xulasho ah loo dabaqi karo iyadoo ku xiran sifooyinka Aaladda lafteeda.  Fiiro gaar ah: Haddii aad haysato qoraal (script) muddo dheer socda oo ah Isha Xogta, wakhtiga lagu sameeyo Garaafyada wuu kordhi doonaa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Qaabka Sawirka ee caadiga ah ee loo adeegsanayo dhammaan Qaababka Garaafka ee cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php
