msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee spine uu sugayo inuu script ku dhammaado. Qiimahan waqti-dhammaadku wuxuu ku cabbiran yahay ilbiriqsiyo wuxuuna u shaqeeyaa labada Ururiye Xogood ee cmd.php iyo spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Xakamaynta Soo-noqnoqoshada 'Poller Output Not Empty'"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "Haddii ay dhibaato kaa haysato ilaha xogta qaarkood, iimaylkaaga waxaa buuxin kara digniinaha 'Poller Output Not Empty' (Natiijada Poller-ku Ma Marna). Haddii ay tani dhacayso, waxaad xakamayn kartaa soo noqnoqoshada dejinta iyadoo lagu salaynayo muddadan."

