msgstr "Xadka Digniinta Tirada ee Hal Saac"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Poller Guarded Ratio (below) is reached breached more than this many times in an hour, a warning will be written to the Cacti log and an Email will be sent to the Primary Cact Administraror notifying them of the Poller runtime deviation."
msgstr "Marka Saamiga Ilaalinta Poller-ka (hoose) la jebiyo wax ka badan intan oo jeer hal saac gudahood, digniin ayaa lagu qori doonaa diiwaanka Cacti, iimaylna waxaa loo diri doonaa Maamulaha Koowaad ee Cacti iyadoo lagu ogeysiinayo leexashada waqtiga shaqada ee Poller-ka."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
