#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Dejimaha Cusboonaysiinta RRD ee Dalabka ku Xiran"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Daar Cusboonaysiinta RRD ee Dalabka ku Xiran"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Boost ma inuu ka daaro Cacti cusboonaysiinta RRD ee dalabka ku xiran? Haddii aad damiso, isbeddelkani ma dhaqan galayo ilaa wareegga xiga ee ururinta xogta ka dib. Marka aad leedahay Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog, dejintan waxaa loo baahan yahay inay daarantahay."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Cusboonaysiiyaha RRD ee Heerka Nidaamka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Ka hor intaan la nadiifin karin Cusboonaysiinta RRD ee Dalabka ku Xiran, socodsiinta poller-ku waa inay mar walba gudubtaa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Intee jeer ayuu Boost cusboonaysiinayaa dhammaan RRD-yada"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Marka aad daarto Boost, faylashaada RRD waxaa la cusboonaysiiyaa oo keliya marka uu isticmaale codsado, ama marka muddadan wakhtigu dhammaato."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Tirada Hawlaha Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Tirada hawlaha Boost ee isku mar shaqaynaya ee loo adeegsanayo ka shaqaynta dhammaan RRD-yada ku jira shaxda Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Diiwaannada Ugu Badan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Haddii shaxda wax-soo-saarka Boost ay ka badato cabbirkan, marka la eego diiwaannada, cusboonaysiin ayaa dhici doonta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Walxaha Isha Xogta ee Ugu Badan Halkii Mar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Si loo wanaajiyo waxqabadka, cusboonaysiiyaha RRD ee Boost wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu ogaado inta Walxaha Isha Xogta ee laga soo qaadanayo hal mar. Fadlan ka taxaddar inaadan aad u sarraysiin maadaama waxqabadka samaynta garaafyada inta lagu jiro cusboonaysiinta waaweyn uu hoos u dhici karo. Haddii aad la kulanto gaabis xagga garaafyada ama ururinta xogta ah inta lagu jiro cusboonaysiinta, yaree lambarkan. Qiimaha caadiga ah waa 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Dhererka Ugu Badan ee Halbeegga Amarka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Marka Boost uu u diro amarro cusboonaysiin RRDtool, kama badan karo Dhererka Ugu Badan ee Halbeegga Amarka ee nidaamka hawlgalka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay nidaamka hawlgalka iyo heerka kernel-ka. Tusaale ahaan: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ aan xad lahayn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Xadka Xusuusta ee Boost iyo Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Xaddiga ugu badan ee xusuusta ee Cacti Poller iyo Boost Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Waqtiga Ugu Badan ee Socodka Qoraalka Cusboonaysiinta RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Haddii Boost poller-ku ka bato waqtigan socodka, digniin ayaa lagu qori doonaa diiwaanka Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Boost Debugging"
msgstr "Daar Baaritaanka Khaladaadka Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set, Boost will log debug information directly to the Boost log file.  Please note, enabling can cause a high I/O rate on the local file system."
msgstr "Haddii la dejiyo, Boost wuxuu si toos ah ugu qori doonaa macluumaadka baaritaanka khaladaadka faylka diiwaanka Boost. Fadlan ogow, daarista tani waxay keeni kartaa heer sare oo I/O ah nidaamka faylalka gudaha."

