msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples."
msgstr "Waxaa jira laba hab oo ka-saaris ah. Midda koowaad, Leexashada Caadiga ah (Standard Deviation), waxay ka saari doontaa muunad kasta oo ka fog celceliska muunadaha X tiro oo leexashooyin caadi ah."

