#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>FIIRO GAAR AH:</strong> Waxaad ku gashay Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog. Marka uu ku jiro <b>'khadka'</b>, waxaad awood u yeelan doontaa inaad aragto oo aad maamusho inta badan Bogga Webka ee Ugu Weyn ee Cacti sidii adigoo isaga ku jira. Sidoo kale, waxaa muhiim ah in la ogaado in Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog looga baahan yahay inay isticmaalaan Adeegyada Kordhinta Waxqabadka Cacti ee astaanta <b>'Cusbooneysiinta Markii Loo Baahdo'</b>, waxaana mar walba ku talinaynaa isticmaalka Spine. Marka Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog uu <b>'khadka ka maqan yahay'</b>, Bogga Webka ee Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog wuxuu yeelan doonaa xog aad uga yar. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, wuxuu kaydin doonaa dhammaan cusbooneysiinta ilaa Xog-ururinta Ugu Weyn ee Cacti iyo Adeegaha Webka la gaari karo. Ka dibna wuxuu dib ugu shubi doonaa natiijada shaxda Boost ee Xog-ururinta Ugu Weyn ee Cacti si loo cusbooneysiiyo."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>FIIRO GAAR AH:</strong> Midna ka mid ah Ku-xidhayaasha Aasaasiga ah ee Cacti, ilaa hadda, dib looma naqshadeyn si ay ula shaqeeyaan Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog. Sidaas darteed, Ku-xidhayaasha sida MacTrack, iyo HMIB, kuwaas oo u baahan gelitaan toos ah oo aaladaha ah, lama shaqayn doonaan Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog waqtigan. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, ku-xidhayaasha sida Thold way shaqayn doonaan ilaa inta Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog uu ku jiro habka <b>'khadka ku jira'</b>."

