#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti requires several PHP Modules to be installed to work properly. If any of these are not installed, you will be unable to continue the installation until corrected. In addition, for optimal system performance Cacti should be run with certain MySQL system variables set.  Please follow the MySQL recommendations at your discretion.  Always seek the MySQL documentation if you have any questions."
msgstr "Cacti waxay u baahan tahay in la rakibo dhowr Module oo PHP ah si ay si sax ah ugu shaqeyso. Haddii mid ka mid ah kuwan aan la rakibin, ma awoodi doontid inaad sii waddo rakibidda ilaa laga saxo. Intaa waxaa dheer, si nidaamku u gaaro waxqabadka ugu wanaagsan, Cacti waa in lagu socodsiiyaa iyadoo la dejiyay doorsoomayaal gaar ah oo nidaamka MySQL ah.  Fadlan raac talooyinka MySQL sida aad doorbido.  Had iyo jeer la tasho dukumentiyada MySQL haddii aad qabto wax su'aalo ah."

#: lib/installer.php
