#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Kaydka xogta MySQL TimeZone laguma buuxin xog.  Fadlan buuxi kaydkan xogta ka hor intaadan sii wadin."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Koontada gelitaanka kaydka xogta Cacti ma laha rukhsad ay ku gasho kaydka xogta MySQL TimeZone.  Fadlan sii koontada kaydka xogta Cacti rukhsadda \"select\" ee shaxda \"time_zone_name\" ee ku jirta kaydka xogta \"mysql\", oo buuxi macluumaadka TimeZone ee MySQL ka hor intaadan sii wadin."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Koontada kaydka xogta Cacti waxay leedahay rukhsad ay ku gasho kaydka xogta MySQL TimeZone, kaydkaas xogtana waxaa lagu buuxiyay macluumaadka TimeZone ee caalamiga ah."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - Dejinta"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Dejintan hagaajinta waxqabadka MySQL waxay ka caawin doontaa nidaamkaaga Cacti inuu si fiican u shaqeeyo dhibaato la'aan muddo dheer."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Doorsoomayaasha Nidaamka MySQL ee Lagula Talinayo"

