msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Casriyeyn laga bilaabo <strong>%1$s</strong> ilaa <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Haddii ay jiraan dhibaatooyin, waxaa aad loogu talinayaa inaad nadiifiso kaydka ku meel gaarka ah (cache) ee biraawsarkaaga, aad xidho ka dibna dib u furto biraawsarkaaga (ma aha oo kaliya tab-ka Cacti uu ku jiro) oo aad mar kale isku daydo, ka hor intaadan cabasho u gudbin The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Marmar dhif ah, waxaan helnay warbixino ka yimid isticmaalayaal la kulmay dhibaatooyin yaryar oo ay sababeen isbeddelada koodhka.  Dhibaatooyinkan waxaa sababa biraawsarka oo haysta koodhkii casriyeynta ka hor, inkastoo aan qaadnay tallaabooyin lagu yaraynayo fursadaha tan, haddana way dhici kartaa.  Haddii aad u baahan tahay tilmaamo ku saabsan sida loo nadiifiyo kaydka ku meel gaarka ah (cache) ee biraawsarkaaga, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> waa meel fiican oo laga bilaabo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Haddii ka dib markaad nadiifiso kaydka ku meel gaarka ah (cache) oo aad dib u bilowdo biraawsarkaaga aad weli la kulanto dhibaatooyin, fadlan noo soo gudbi arrinta waxaanan isku dayi doonaa inaan ogaano sababta keentay."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Hoos-u-dhigid laga bilaabo <strong>%1$s</strong> ilaa <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Waxaad u muuqataa inaad hoos ugu dhigeyso nooc hore.  Isbeddelada kaydka xogta ee loo sameeyay nooca cusub dib looma celin doono waxayna <i>keeni karaan</i> dhibaatooyin."

