msgstr "Nooca Nidaamka Hawlgalka Server-ka: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Central Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Macluumaadka Xidhiidhka Kaydka Xogta Dhexe"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Habayntu Waa Akhris-Kaliya!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Faylkaaga config.php waa inuu noqdaa mid uu wax ku qori karo server-ka shabakadda inta lagu jiro rakibidda si loo habeeyo Poller-ka fog.  Marka rakibidda la dhammeeyo, waa inaad faylkan ka dhigtaa Akhris-Kaliya si looga hortago dhibaatooyinka amniga ee suurtogalka ah."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Habaynta Poller-ka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Macluumaadkaaga Remote Cacti Poller laguma darin faylkaaga config.php.  Fadlan dib u eeg config.php.dist, oo deji doorsoomayaasha: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, iwm.  Doorsoomayaashan waa in la dejiyaa oo ay dib ugu tilmaamaan server-ka kaydka xogta Koowaad (Primary) ee Cacti.  Sax tan oo mar kale isku day."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Doorsoomayaasha Poller-ka Fog"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Doorsoomayaasha ay tahay in lagu dejiyo faylka config.php waxaa ka mid ah kuwan soo socda:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Rakibuhu wuxuu si toos ah u qoondeeyaa $poller_id wuxuuna ku daraa faylka config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Marka doorsoomayaasha oo dhan lagu dejiyo faylka config.php, waa inaad sidoo kale siisaa $rdatabase_username ogolaanshaha gelitaanka serfarka kaydka xogta (database) ee ugu muhiimsan ee Cacti. Raac isla habraaca aad raaci lahayd rakibid kasta oo kale oo Cacti ah. Kadib waxaad riixi kartaa badhanka 'Tijaabi Xiriirka'. Haddii tijaabadu guuleysato waxaad awoodi doontaa inaad sii waddo oo aad dhammaystirto rakibidda."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Tallaabooyin Dheeraad ah Rakibidda Kadib"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Waa lagama maarmaan in serfarka Dhexe ee Cacti uu kula xiriiri karo MySQL serfar kasta oo fog oo kaydka xogta Cacti ah. Marka rakibiddu dhammaato, waa inaad wax ka beddeshaa Ururiyaha Xogta Fog (Remote Data Collector) oo aad hubisaa in dejimuhu sax yihiin. Waxaad ku xaqiijin kartaa adigoo adeegsanaya 'Tijaabi Xiriirka' marka aad wax ka beddeleyso Ururiyaha Xogta Fog."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Goobaha iyo Noocyada Barnaamijyada Muhiimka ah (Binaries)"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Hubi in dhammaan qiimayaashan ay sax yihiin ka hor inta aadan sii wadin."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Hal ama in ka badan oo waddooyinka faylasha ah ayaa u muuqda kuwo khaldan, lama sii wadi karo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Hubinta Ogolaanshaha Galka (Directory)"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Fadlan hubi in ogolaanshaha gallada hoose ay sax yihiin ka hor inta aadan sii wadin. Inta lagu jiro rakibidda, galladani waxay u baahan yihiin inuu lahaado isticmaalaha Serfarka Webka. Isbeddeladan ogolaanshaha waxaa looga baahan yahay si loogu oggolaado Rakibaha inuu rakibo xirmooyinka Qaab-dhismeedka Qalabka (Device Template) kuwaas oo ay ku jiraan faylasha XML iyo qoraallada (scripts) ee la gelin doono galladan. Haddii aad doorato inaadan rakibin xirmooyinka, waxaa jira qoraal CLI ah oo la yiraahdo 'install_package.php' kaas oo laga isticmaali karo khadka taliska (command line) marka rakibiddu dhammaato."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Marka rakibiddu dhammaato, waxaad qaar ka mid ah galladan ka dhigi kartaa kuwo la akhriyo oo keliya (read-only) si loo kordhiyo amniga."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Galladani waxay u baahan doonaan inay sii ahaadaan kuwo la akhrin karo lana qori karo rakibidda kadib si habka isku-duwidda fog ee Cacti uu u cusboonaysiiyo marka Bogga Webka Ugu Muhiimsan ee Cacti isbeddelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Haddii aad rakibayso xirmooyin, marka xirmooyinka la rakibo, waa inaad galka qoraallada (scripts) dib ugu beddeshaa mid la akhriyo oo keliya maadaama tani ay keeni karto halis amni oo ku wajahan bogga webka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Ururiyayaasha fog (remote pollers), waxaa aad muhiim u ah in waddooyinka aad sida joogtada ah u cusboonaysiin doonto, oo ay ku jiraan waddooyinka plugins, scripts, iyo resources, ay haystaan ogolaansho akhris/qoris maadaama ururiyaha xogta uu ku khasbanaan doono inuu waddooyinkan ka cusboonaysiiyo nuxurka serfarka webka ugu muhiimsan."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Waxaa Loo Baahan Yahay Qorista Waqtiga Rakibidda oo Keliya"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Lama Qori Karo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Waxaa Loo Baahan Yahay Qorista Rakibidda Kadib"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Arrimo suurtagal ah oo ku saabsan ogolaanshaha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Fadlan hubi in serfarkaaga webka uu haysto ogolaansho akhris/qoris ah ee gallada cacti ee muujinaya khaladaadka hoose."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Haddii SELinux ay ka shaqaynayso serfarkaaga, waxaad si joogto ah u joojin kartaa tan, ama si ku meel gaar ah ayaad u joojin kartaa kadibna waxaad ku dari kartaa ogolaanshaha ku habboon adigoo adeegsanaya qalabka khadka taliska ee SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Isticmaalaha '%s' waa inuu haystaa ogolaanshaha MODIFY si loo awoodsiiyo akhriska/qorista."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Tusaale ku saabsan sida loo dejiyo ogolaanshaha galka ayaa halkan lagu muujiyay, inkastoo laga yaabo inaad u baahato inaad wax ka beddesho tan iyadoo ku xiran nidaamkaaga hawlgalka (OS), koontooyinka isticmaalayaasha iyo ogolaanshaha la rabo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "TUSAALE:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Marka rakibiddu dhammaato, waddada CSRF waa in loo dejiyaa mid la akhriyo oo keliya (read-only)."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Dhammaan gallada waa la qori karaa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Linux kernel security modules"
msgstr "Qaybaha amniga ee kernel-ka Linux"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti needs to establish network connections, execute binaries and write files to work. Linux security features such as <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> or <b>ModSecurity</b> may cause Cacti to become inoperable in some configurations. If problems occur, check the settings of these security tools.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Cacti waxay u baahan tahay inay samayso xiriirro shabakad, fuliso barnaamijyo (binaries), oo ay qorto faylal si ay u shaqayso. Astaamaha amniga Linux sida <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> ama <b>ModSecurity</b> waxay sababi karaan in Cacti aysan shaqayn karin qaabeynta qaarkood. Haddii dhibaatooyin dhacaan, hubi dejimaha qalabkan amniga.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Ilaalinta Liiska Cad ee Xaqiijinta Gelinta (Whitelist)"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Hababka Gelinta Xogta (Data Input) ee Cacti ee waca qoraal (script) waxaa looga faa'iidaysan karaa siyaabo qof aan maamule ahayn uu waxyeello ugu geysan karo faylasha uu leeyahay koontada poller-ka, iyo xaaladaha qof uu ku wado Cacti poller isagoo ah root, waxay khatar gelin kartaa nidaamka hawlgalka taas oo u oggolaanaysa weeraryahannada inay ka faa'iidaystaan kaabayaashaaga."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Sidaa darteed, dhowr nooc ka hor, Cacti waxaa lagu xoojiyay inay bixiso awoodaha Liiska Cad (Whitelist) noocyadan Hababka Gelinta Xogta ah. Inkastoo tani ay si buuxda u sugayso amniga Cacti, haddana waxay kordhisaa shaqada looga baahan yahay maamulaha Cacti si uu u soo dejiyo oo uu u maamulo Qaab-dhismeedyada (Templates) iyo Xirmooyinka (Packages)."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Habka uu u shaqeeyo Liiska Cad (Whitelisting) waa marka aad markii ugu horreysay soo dejiso Habka Gelinta Xogta, ama aad dib u soo dejiso Habka Gelinta Xogta, oo qoraalka (script) iyo/ama doodaha (arguments) ay si uun isu beddelaan, Habka Gelinta Xogta iyo dhammaan Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira isla markiiba waa la joojinayaa ilaa maamuluhu uu xaqiijiyo in Habka Gelinta Xogta uu yahay mid sax ah."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Si loo aqoonsado Hababka Gelinta Xogta ee ku jira xaaladdan, waxaan ku diyaarinay qoraal xaqiijin ah galka CLI ee Cacti kaas oo lagu socodsiin karo xulashooyinkan soo socda:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Xulashadan qoraalka ahi waxay raadin doontaa Habab kasta oo Gelinta Xogta ah oo hadda la mamnuucay waxayna bixin doontaa faahfaahinta sababta."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Xulashadan qoraalka ahi waxay ka qaaddaa mamnuucidda Hababka Gelinta Xogta ee hadda mamnuuca ah."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Xulashadan qoraalka ahi waxay dib u hawlgelin doontaa Ilaha Xogta ee la joojiyay."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Waxaa si adag lagugula talinayaa inaad cusboonaysiiso config.php si aad u hawlgeliso sifadan adigoo faallada ka saaraya doorsoomaha <b>$input_whitelist</b> ka dibna aad socodsiiso saddexda xulasho ee qoraalka CLI ee kore marka rakibidda ku salaysan shabakaddu ay dhammaato.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Sax sanduuqa hoose si aad u qirato inaad akhriday oo aad fahantay welwelkan amni"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Waan akhriyay bayaankan"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Admin email address"
msgstr "Cinwaanka iimaylka maamulaha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In case of problems cacti can send emails to the administrator. The address filled in here will be assigned to the admin account and \"Notify Primary Admin of Issue\" will be enabled. You can change this setting and the email address later. Do not forget to set up the email settings after installation."
msgstr "Haddii dhibaatooyin dhacaan cacti waxay u diri kartaa iimayllo maamulaha. Cinwaanka halkan lagu buuxiyay waxaa loo qoondeyn doonaa akoonka maamulaha waxaana la hawlgelin doonaa \"Ogeysii Maamulaha Koowaad Dhibaatada\". Waad beddeli kartaa dejintan iyo cinwaanka iimaylka hadhow. Ha ilaawin inaad habayso dejinta iimaylka rakibidda ka dib."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Astaanta Caadiga ah"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources. This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host. Long retention profiles store more data, so they take up more disk capacity. Their advantage is that older data is not as consolidated and is therefore more accurate than using shorter retention."
msgstr "Fadlan dooro Astaanta Isha Xogta ee caadiga ah si loogu adeegsado ilaha xog-ururinta. Tani waa wakhtiga ugu badan ee u dhexeeya baaritaanka aaladaha si xog looga helo, sidaas darteed mar kasta oo muddada xog-ururintu yaraato, waxaa sii kordha shaqada fuusha martigeliyaha Server-ka Cacti. Astaamaha kaydinta dheer waxay kaydiyaan xog badan, sidaas darteed waxay qaataan awood disk oo badan. Faa'iidadoodu waa in xogtii hore aan si aad ah loo koobin oo ay sidaas darteed ka saxsan tahay isticmaalka kaydinta gaaban."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Sidoo kale, dooro muddada Cron ee loogu talagalay ama la habeeyay ee aad rabto inaad u isticmaasho Ururinta Xogta."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
