msgstr "Habka"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Qaabka uu Cacti isku dayayo inuu ku xaqiijiyo aqoonsiga adeegaha LDAP.<blockquote><i>Raadin La'aan</i> - Ma dhacdo wax raadin ah oo ku saabsan Magaca Gaarka ah (DN), kaliya wuxuu isku dayaa inuu ku xirmo qaabka Magaca Gaarka ah (DN) ee la bixiyay.<br><br><i>Raadinta Qarsoon</i> - Wuxuu isku dayaa inuu magaca isticmaalaha ka raadiyo buugga LDAP isagoo adeegsanaya xirid qarsoon si uu u helo Magaca Gaarka ah (DN) ee isticmaalayaasha.<br><br><i>Raadin Gaar ah</i> - Wuxuu isku dayaa inuu magaca isticmaalaha ka raadiyo buugga LDAP isagoo adeegsanaya Magac Gaar ah (DN) iyo Eray-sir Gaar ah oo loogu talagalay xiridda si uu u helo Magaca Gaarka ah (DN) ee isticmaalayaasha.<br><br><i>Erayada-sirta ee Hal-mar ah (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti wuxuu erayga-sirta ee isticmaalaha ku xiraa hal mar oo keliya, inta lagu jiro xaqiijinta kama dambaysta ah. <i>Raadin La'aan</i> ma sameeyo wax baaritaan buug ah wuxuuna si toos ah ugu xirmaa isagoo adeegsanaya qaab-dhismeedka Magaca Gaarka ah (DN), sidaas darteed wuxuu ammaan u yahay OTP marka qaab-dhismeedka DN oo keliya uu aqoonsado isticmaalaha. Marka baaritaan buug loo baahdo si loo helo DN, isticmaal <i>Raadin Gaar ah</i> oo leh akoon adeeg oo gooni ah (ama <i>Raadinta Qarsoon</i> halka buuggu oggol yahay) si baaritaanku uusan marnaba u isticmaalin koodhka hal-mar la adeegsado. Dejinta OTP ee adkeysiga leh, ku isticmaal hal magac oo dheellitiraha culeyska DNS ah goobta Server(s) halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd liis adeegayaal badan oo boos lagu kala soocay, taas oo dib isugu dayi lahayd xiridda iyadoo la adeegsanayo eray-sir hal-mar ah oo horay loo isticmaalay."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Magaca Gaarka ah (DN)"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedka \"Magaca Gaarka ah\", oo lagu dabaqi karo qaabaynta OpenLDAP iyo Windows AD labadaba, wuxuu bixiyaa dabacsanaan lagu qeexayo aqoonsiga isticmaalaha. OpenLDAP ahaan, qaabku wuxuu raacaa qaab-dhismeedkan: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD wuxuu bixiyaa qaab-dhismeed kale: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, oo caan ku ah \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". Xaaladdan dhexdeeda, \"&lt;username&gt;\" wuxuu matalaa magaca isticmaalaha gaarka ah ee la bixiyo inta lagu jiro gelitaanka. Tani waxay si gaar ah muhiim u tahay marka lagu shaqeynayo habka \"Raadin La'aan\", ama marka \"U Baahan Xubinimada Kooxda\" uu shidan yahay."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"

